    {
      "id": 33881,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "@nagli found a stored Cross-Site Scripting vulnerability in a 3rd party vendor that was used by HackerOne. This system did not contain any data related to reports submitted and stored on hackerone.com. HackerOne worked with the vendor to remediate the vulnerability. The report is partially disclosed to anonymize the vendor.",
